**Block file for optimization

*INCLUDE, INPUT = mesh.nam
*INCLUDE, INPUT = Nfix1.nam
*INCLUDE, INPUT = NSurface.nam

** Node set Nfix1 has DOF 1(X), DOF 2(Y), DOF 3(Z) fixed
*BOUNDARY
Nfix1,1,3


**Add material named EL with elastic properties
*MATERIAL,NAME=EL
*ELASTIC
210e5,0.3
*DENSITY
2700


** Apply material EL to element set EALL
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=EALL, MATERIAL=EL

** Design variable definition
*NSET, NSET=DES
1

*DESIGNVARIABLES, TYPE=COORDINATE
DES


*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=EALL, MATERIAL=EL
*STEP
*STATIC
**Begin setup for static analysis

** Define concentrated load on <nodeset>, <dof>, <magnitude>
**DLOAD
**EALL,GRAV,9.810, 0., 0., -1
*CLOAD
Nsurface, 2, -3.143
*END STEP




*NODE FILE
 U
***EL FILE
** S, E
*END STEP



*STEP
*SENSITIVITY
*OBJECTIVE
STRAINENERGY
*END STEP
